# How many ways can a Rubik's cube be mixed up?
subtitle: "Guess how many ways a Rubik's cube can be mixed up, on a scale of powers of ten, then learn why every mess is at most twenty moves from solved."

## How many ways can a Rubik's cube be mixed up?
affirm: playful
sources:
    - id: cube20
      title: God's Number is 20
      authors: T. Rokicki, H. Kociemba, M. Davidson, J. Dethridge
      year: 2010
      url: https://cube20.org/
      finding: every one of the 43,252,003,274,489,856,000 positions can be solved in 20 moves or fewer; about 35 CPU-years donated by Google
